    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Segundo», «de acordo com»",
     "texto": [
      "To give the source: **Segundo a notícia** (according to the news), **de acordo com as autoridades** (according to the authorities).",
      "You already know it from indirect speech, but here it's used to cite the source."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive voice in the news",
     "texto": [
      "In the news the passive voice is very common: **Foi anunciado um novo metro** (a new metro was announced). **Foram encontrados mais de cem casos** (more than one hundred cases were found).",
      "The participles agree with the subject."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
